m/ib-security-assistant-executive-2025/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Start Date: <strong>26 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>17 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <strong>17 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Details :<strong> 15 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :<strong> 29-30 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Date : <strong>26 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key :<strong> 04 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Result Declared Date : <b>17 December 2025\u00a0</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Tier-II Admit Card 2026 : </span><strong>10 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Tier-II Result : <strong>08 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Interview Date : 01 \u2013 29 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interview Letter : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>22 May 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-